.TP
.BI f x ", " F x ", " t x ", " T x ", " ; ", " ,
Find
.I x
forward or backward, stop before it, or repeat the find.
.TP
.BR k ", " j ", " Up ", " Down ", " Ctrl\-P ", " Ctrl\-N
Move between rows; k and j recall history from the first or last row.
.TP
.BR gg ", " G
Move to the first or last row, or row N with a count.
.TP
